<title>USA: Total-Tel Q4 shr $0.14 vs $0.09.</title>
<headline>Total-Tel Q4 shr $0.14 vs $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE FALLS, NJ 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.14		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net		 494			301</p>
<p> Revs		24,890		   14,284</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  3,462		    3,318</p>
<p>	  Fiscal year ended Jan. 31</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.75		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net		 2,588		    1,555</p>
<p> Revs		89,325		   49,873</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  3,433		    3,283</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company reporting operating income for the fourth quarter at $766,921 compared to $382,120.</p>
<p>The company said that over the next 12 months, it will double its revenue producing capacity.It also plans to extend its network to open the European market. </p>
<p>The company's full name is Total-Tel USA Communications Inc.</p>
